OL,3,GNEWSATown council petition vows 'loud
OL,4,Aand clear voice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSetting up a town council for a
OL,7,FNottinghamshire suburb will give
OL,8,Fresidents "a clear voice", a campaigner
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FA campaign group wants to establish a
OL,12,Ftown council for West Bridgford after
OL,13,F50 years of being the only local area
OL,14,Fwithout any authority below the borough
OL,15,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
