OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1788346551
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSATown council petition vows 'loud
OL,4,Aand clear voice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Calvert, Labour councillor for
OL,7,FRushcliffe Borough Council, and a
OL,8,Fmember of the West Bridgford Town
OL,9,FCouncil Group, believes the extra tier
OL,10,Fwould protect the community's
OL,11,F"distinctiveness" amid the pending
OL,12,Freorganisation of local government.
OL,14,FRushcliffe Borough Council, which does
OL,15,Fnot support the bid, said consulting on
OL,16,Fthe matter and the running of town
OL,17,Fcouncil had multiple "cost factors"
OL,18,Fwhich would affect taxpayers.
